fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gsth266parser.html#GstH266RefPicLists","fragment":"\n\tGstH266RefPicLists\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266RefPicLists\n\nMembers\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H266RefPicLists\n\nMembers\nStructure defining the H266 reference picture lists.\nspecifies whether RPL i in ref_pic_lists is derived based\non one of the ref_pic_list_struct(listIdx, rplsIdx) syntax structures\nwith listIdx equal to i in the SPS.\nspecifies the index into the list of the\nref_pic_list_struct(listIdx, rplsIdx) syntax structures.\nreference list of GstH266RefPicListStruct.\nspecifies the value of the picture order count\nmodulo MaxPicOrderCntLsb.\nspecifies whether\ndelta_poc_msb_cycle_lt[i][j] is present.\nspecifies the value of the variable FullPocLt[i][j].\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 reference picture lists.\nspecifies whether RPL i in ref_pic_lists is derived based\non one of the ref_pic_list_struct(listIdx, rplsIdx) syntax structures\nwith listIdx equal to i in the SPS.\nspecifies the index into the list of the\nref_pic_list_struct(listIdx, rplsIdx) syntax structures.\nreference list of GstCodecParsers.H266RefPicListStruct.\nspecifies the value of the picture order count\nmodulo MaxPicOrderCntLsb.\nspecifies whether\ndelta_poc_msb_cycle_lt[i][j] is present.\nspecifies the value of the variable FullPocLt[i][j].\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nStructure defining the H266 reference picture lists.\nspecifies whether RPL i in ref_pic_lists is derived based\non one of the ref_pic_list_struct(listIdx, rplsIdx) syntax structures\nwith listIdx equal to i in the SPS.\nspecifies the index into the list of the\nref_pic_list_struct(listIdx, rplsIdx) syntax structures.\nreference list of GstCodecParsers.H266RefPicListStruct.\nspecifies the value of the picture order count\nmodulo MaxPicOrderCntLsb.\nspecifies whether\ndelta_poc_msb_cycle_lt[i][j] is present.\nspecifies the value of the variable FullPocLt[i][j].\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t